      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I have implemented this functionality in U#, however it has to do a recursive-walk, which is rather slow and inefficient inside of Udon. Therefor implementing this directly on the C# side would be much appreciated.\n\nBut better than nothing I suppose.\n\nhttps://gist.github.com/TheHelpfulHelper/0b059ac91901ecec048306c4a94cd71a",
