  "deletedAt": null,
  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "Currently References and Error-DataTokens cannot be serialized and will cause a serialization failure.\n\nThis is especially unhelpful for debugging DataDictionary or DataLists when utilizing references in them.\n\nThere should be a function which does pretty much the same as VRCJson.TrySerializeToJson however with the intent purpose for debugging, where references get formatted into \"[Reference]\" or something like that and Error Tokens get formatted according to \"ERROR: {message}\" or similar.\n\nThis would greatly improve the debugging experience of DataDictionaries/Lists.",
